@attribute [Route("/components/" + nameof(HxPopover))]

<ApiDoc Type="typeof(HxPopover)">
	<MainContent>
		<DocAlert Type="DocAlertType.Warning">
			The popover wrapper is rendered only if the <code>Title</code>, <code>Content</code>, or <code>WrapperCssClass</code> parameters are set.
			If all are <code>null</code> or empty, only the <code>ChildContent</code> is rendered.
		</DocAlert>

		<DocHeading Title="Basic usage" />
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_BasicUsage)" Tabs="false" />

		<DocHeading Title="Placement" />
		<p>You can change the placement of the popover with the <code>@nameof(HxPopover.Placement)</code> parameter:</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_Placement)" />

		<DocHeading Title="HTML content" />
		<p>Use <code>Html="true"</code> to enable HTML in your content.</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_HtmlContent)" />

		<DocHeading Title="HTML sanitization" Level="3" />
		<p>By default, the HTML content gets <a href="https://v6-dev--twbs-bootstrap.netlify.app/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript/#sanitizer">sanitized</a>. To disable sanitization, set <code>Sanitize="false"</code>.</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_HtmlContent_Sanitize)" />

		<DocHeading Title="Dismiss on next click" />
		<p>Use the <code>Trigger="PopoverTrigger.Focus"</code> to dismiss popovers on the user’s next click of a different element than the toggle element.</p>
		<DocAlert Type="DocAlertType.Warning">
			Dismissing on next click requires specific HTML for proper cross-browser and cross-platform behavior. You can only use <code>a</code> elements, not <code>button</code>, and you must include a tabindex.
		</DocAlert>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_Dismissible)" />

		<DocHeading Title="Custom popovers" />
		<p>
			You can customize the appearance of popovers using <a href="/components/HxPopover#HxPopover-css-variables">CSS variables</a>.
			Use the <code>@nameof(HxPopover.CssClass)</code> parameter to add a custom class to the popover element and use it to override the local CSS variables.
			In the example below, the custom class maps the border and header colors to the Bootstrap <code>theme-*</code> variables, so you can combine it with any <code>theme-*</code> class.
		</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_Custom)" />

		<DocHeading Title="Disabled elements" />
		<p>
			Disabled elements use <code>pointer-events: none</code>, so they can't directly receive the hover, focus, or click events that trigger a popover.
			<code>HxPopover</code> wraps its content in a <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> and attaches the trigger to that wrapper, so popovers work on disabled elements out of the box&mdash;no extra markup required.
		</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_DisabledElements)" Tabs="false" />

		<DocHeading Title="Programmability" />
		<p>
			You can use the <code>ShowAsync()</code> and <code>HideAsync()</code> methods, as well as the <code>OnShown</code> and <code>OnHidden</code> events,
			to program your own interaction.
		</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_MethodsEvents)" />
		<p>You can also use the <code>DisableAsync()</code> and <code>EnableAsync()</code> methods to control the popover behavior.</p>
		<Demo Type="typeof(HxPopover_Demo_EnableDisable)" />
	</MainContent>
	<CssVariables>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-zindex" Default="var(--bs-z-popover)">
			Z-index of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-max-width" Default="280px">
			Maximum width of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-font-size" Default="var(--bs-font-size-sm)">
			Font size of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-bg" Default="var(--bs-bg-body)">
			Background color of the popover (and its arrow).
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-border-width" Default="var(--bs-border-width)">
			Border width of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-border-color" Default="var(--bs-border-color-translucent)">
			Border color of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-border-radius" Default="var(--bs-radius-7)">
			Border radius of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-inner-border-radius" Default="calc(var(--bs-radius-7) - var(--bs-border-width))">
			Border radius of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-box-shadow" Default="var(--bs-box-shadow)">
			Box shadow of the popover.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-header-padding-x" Default="var(--bs-spacer)">
			Horizontal padding of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-header-padding-y" Default="var(--bs-spacer-3)">
			Vertical padding of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-header-font-size" Default="var(--bs-font-size-sm)">
			Font size of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-header-color" Default="inherit">
			Text color of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-header-bg" Default="var(--bs-bg-1)">
			Background color of the popover header.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-body-padding-x" Default="var(--bs-spacer)">
			Horizontal padding of the popover body.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-body-padding-y" Default="var(--bs-spacer-3)">
			Vertical padding of the popover body.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-body-color" Default="var(--bs-fg-body)">
			Text color of the popover body.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-arrow-width" Default="1rem">
			Width of the popover arrow.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-arrow-height" Default=".5rem">
			Height of the popover arrow.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-arrow-border" Default="var(--bs-popover-border-color)">
			Border color of the popover arrow.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-transition-property" Default="opacity">
			CSS property animated when the popover is shown or hidden.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-transition-duration" Default=".15s">
			Duration of the show/hide transition.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
		<ApiDocCssVariable Name="--bs-popover-transition-timing" Default="linear">
			Timing function of the show/hide transition.
		</ApiDocCssVariable>
	</CssVariables>
</ApiDoc>
